abstract: "The ndif package (gates G0-G8, the two assessed estimators, the five comparison methods and the minimum-action solver), the drivers, settings and stored outputs of the assessments reported in the manuscript Assessing dynamical identifiability in neural recordings, the analysis scripts behind the other reported results, and the stored summaries from which its figures are drawn."
